+Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:29:01 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: describe disabled J72 touch resources
+
+Describe SPI2 and the PWM-derived reference clock, J72 SPI and display-sync pin routes, and the D2089 touch supply relationships. Keep all new providers disabled until the dependent touchscreen consumer and its normal startup path are integrated and qualified.
+
+Assisted-by: LLM
+---
