+
+Host fixtures exercise actual C helpers, input emission, acquisition and provider fault paths. ARM64 W=1 touchscreen object builds. Native power/provider integration and cold touchscreen behavior remain unqualified until hardware testing; the inactive-state policy is a candidate derived from private captured reports.
