+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: thisiscamk <100883750+thisiscamk@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:29:00 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH] spi: apple: restore optional S5L8960X idle pins on detach
+
+Select the controller sleep pin state after children have detached and before releasing its retained power reference. Restrict this cleanup to the new S5L8960X match data.
+
+Assisted-by: LLM
+---
